{"seq":3,"slug":"segment-leafgrim","title":"号段/Leaf 模式：数据库取号与本地缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-id-clock-ordering/snowflake-family/segment-leafgrim","wordCount":1696,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"号段-leaf-模式-数据库取号与本地缓存\">号段/Leaf 模式：数据库取号与本地缓存</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Snowflake 把「机器身份」编进 ID 来避免协调，号段模式反其道而行：不编机器身份，而是让所有实例向一个中心（通常是数据库）批量申请一段连续号码，拿到后在本地内存里逐号发放。因为号码本身来自中心的单调递增序列，实例之间不需要区分身份——谁拿到的号段不同，发出来的 ID 自然不同。</p>\n<p>这个思路的典型实现是美团的 Leaf-segment。核心表极简（来源：美团技术博客《Leaf——美团点评分布式ID生成系统》，<code>leaf_alloc</code> 表含 <code>biz_tag</code> 主键、<code>max_id</code> 默认 1、<code>step</code> 列，示例行 <code>step = 2000</code>，<a href=\"https://tech.meituan.com/2017/04/21/mt-leaf.html）：\">https://tech.meituan.com/2017/04/21/mt-leaf.html）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE leaf_alloc (&#10;  biz_tag     VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  max_id      BIGINT       NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  step        INT          NOT NULL DEFAULT 1000,&#10;  updated_at  TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;                          ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (biz_tag)&#10;) ENGINE = InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> leaf_alloc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  biz_tag     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  step        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                          ON UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (biz_tag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>取号的语义是「把 <code>max_id</code> 原子地推进 <code>step</code>，并把自己推进前的那段区间据为己有」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE leaf_alloc&#10;SET max_id = max_id + step&#10;WHERE biz_tag = &#39;order&#39;&#10;RETURNING max_id - step AS segment_start, max_id - 1 AS segment_end;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leaf_alloc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> biz_tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING max_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segment_start, max_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> segment_end;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同数据库的写法略有差异（MySQL 用 <code>LAST_INSERT_ID(max_id + step)</code> 或在事务里先 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 再 <code>UPDATE</code>），但语义一致：一次更新换一段号码。之后实例在本地维护一个游标，从 <code>segment_start</code> 递增到 <code>segment_end</code>，全程无网络往返。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实例 A 本地缓冲] --&gt;|用完| C[向 DB 申请号段]&#10;    B[实例 B 本地缓冲] --&gt;|用完| C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;UPDATE leaf_alloc&lt;br/&gt;max_id += step&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;实例 A 得到 1001..2000&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;实例 B 得到 2001..3000&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[本地内存递增发放&lt;br/&gt;零网络开销]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{缓冲低于阈值?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[异步预取下一段]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| G\">graph TD\n    A[实例 A 本地缓冲] --&gt;|用完| C[向 DB 申请号段]\n    B[实例 B 本地缓冲] --&gt;|用完| C\n    C --&gt; D[\"UPDATE leaf_alloc&lt;br/&gt;max_id += step\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"实例 A 得到 1001..2000\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"实例 B 得到 2001..3000\"]\n    E --&gt; G[本地内存递增发放&lt;br/&gt;零网络开销]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{缓冲低于阈值?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[异步预取下一段]\n    H --&gt;|否| G</pre><h2 id=\"双缓冲-把取号延迟藏起来\">双缓冲：把取号延迟藏起来</h2><p>号段模式最直接的性能问题是「取号瞬间的延迟尖刺」：平时本地发放是纳秒级，一旦当前号段用尽，就要同步去数据库取号，这一次往返可能是毫秒级甚至更差。若请求量高，号段会在极短时间内耗尽，尖刺频繁出现。</p>\n<p>解法是双缓冲（double buffer）加异步预取。实例同时持有「当前号段」与「下一号段」。当当前号段的消耗超过某个阈值（例如 10%）时，后台线程异步申请下一段（来源：美团 Leaf 博客，原文「当前号段已下发 10% 时，如果下一个号段未更新，则另启一个更新线程去更新下一个号段」，并建议号段长度取峰值 QPS 的约 600 倍，<a href=\"https://tech.meituan.com/2017/04/21/mt-leaf.html）；当前号段真正用完时，直接切换到已就绪的下一段，把切换开销降到接近零。\">https://tech.meituan.com/2017/04/21/mt-leaf.html）；当前号段真正用完时，直接切换到已就绪的下一段，把切换开销降到接近零。</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Segment = { start: number; end: number };&#10;&#10;export class SegmentBuffer {&#10;  private segments: [Segment | null, Segment | null] = [null, null];&#10;  private cursor = 0;&#10;  private pos = 0;&#10;&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private readonly step: number,&#10;    private readonly loader: (() =&gt; Promise&lt;Segment&gt;)[],&#10;  ) {}&#10;&#10;  async next(loaders: (() =&gt; Promise&lt;Segment&gt;)[]): Promise&lt;number&gt; {&#10;    const cur = this.segments[this.cursor];&#10;    if (!cur || this.pos &gt; cur.end) {&#10;      const nextIdx = 1 - this.cursor;&#10;      if (!this.segments[nextIdx]) this.segments[nextIdx] = await loaders[nextIdx]();&#10;      this.cursor = nextIdx;&#10;      this.pos = this.segments[nextIdx]!.start;&#10;    }&#10;    const value = this.pos;&#10;    this.pos += 1;&#10;    const remain = cur ? cur.end - this.pos : 0;&#10;    if (cur &amp;&amp; remain &lt; this.step * 0.1)&#10;      void loaders[1 - this.cursor]().then((s) =&gt; {&#10;        this.segments[1 - this.cursor] = s;&#10;      });&#10;    return value;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Segment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SegmentBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> segments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Segment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Segment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cursor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> loader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Segment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">loaders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Segment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cur</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segments[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cursor];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur.end) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nextIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cursor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segments[nextIdx]) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segments[nextIdx] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loaders[nextIdx]();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cursor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextIdx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segments[nextIdx]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> remain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur.end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loaders[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cursor]().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.segments[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cursor] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意两个设计点。第一，预取必须「可与主流程并发」，否则等于没优化。第二，预取失败必须被容忍——失败时后续的同步取号会重试，不能让一个后台异常终止缓冲池的补货循环。生产实现里还常见「预取失败后按指数退避重试，退避期间使用当前号段」的兜底逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"step-的取值-空洞-延迟与数据库压力的三角\">step 的取值：空洞、延迟与数据库压力的三角</h2><p><code>step</code> 决定每次申请的号码数量，它同时调节三个量。</p>\n<p>调大 <code>step</code>：数据库压力降低（同样 QPS 下取号次数减少），取号尖刺频率降低，但「实例崩溃时浪费的号码」变多。一个实例领了 100 万号却只用了 1 万，剩下 99 万就成为永久空洞。调小 <code>step</code>：浪费少，但取号频繁，数据库压力上升，尖刺增多。</p>\n<p>空洞本身是否可接受，取决于 ID 的用途。作为数据库主键，空洞完全无害——它不占存储、不影响性能、不影响唯一性。但有两个场景会让人介意：一是需要 ID 连续的业务（如发票号、凭证号，法规可能要求连号），二是把 ID 差值当作「业务量」来监控的看板。</p>\n<p>推荐取值方式是按「实例的平均续期周期」反推：设单实例峰值 QPS 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，希望一次申请的号段至少能撑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">step \\approx q \\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 秒、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = 2000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span></span></span></span></span> QPS 时，<code>step</code> 约 12 万。这样每实例每分钟取号一次，数据库侧压力是实例数/60 次每秒，完全可控；同时崩溃最多浪费 12 万个号，对 64 位空间毫无影响。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>step 取值</th>\n<th>数据库取号频率</th>\n<th>崩溃浪费</th>\n<th>尖刺频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 000</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低 QPS、要求号码紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 000</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>一般业务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 000</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高 QPS 写入型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 000 000</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>超高 QPS、不介意空洞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与-snowflake-的取舍和混合方案\">与 Snowflake 的取舍和混合方案</h2><p>把两种方案放在一起对比，选择依据就清楚了。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Snowflake</th>\n<th>号段模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ID 语义</td>\n<td>含时间、机器、序列</td>\n<td>纯递增整数，不含时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间排序</td>\n<td>是，可反解时间</td>\n<td>只能推断大致顺序，不可反解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对外依赖</td>\n<td>时钟（强）+ workerId 协调（弱）</td>\n<td>数据库（强）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟回拨影响</td>\n<td>直接受影响</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点故障</td>\n<td>无（本地发号）</td>\n<td>数据库不可用则无法补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量上限</td>\n<td>由位宽决定</td>\n<td>由 BIGINT 决定，实际无限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发吞吐</td>\n<td>受序列位约束</td>\n<td>受 step 与本地内存约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键差异在两点。第一，号段 ID 没有时间语义：ID 越大只说明「号码被申请的次序更晚（或同一号段内位置更靠后）」，但无法反解出发生时间，也无法跨实例比较「谁先谁后」，因为不同实例的号段可能交错发放却按号码顺序发出。这在需要按时间排查问题时会明显不便。第二，号段模式对数据库的依赖是「硬依赖补货」，而 Snowflake 对 workerId 中心的依赖是「启动时依赖，运行期不依赖」，两者的故障画像完全不同。</p>\n<p>实践中存在混合方案：用号段模式发号，但 ID 的高位仍放时间戳，即以「时间戳 + 号段内序号」两段构成 ID。这样既保留时间语义，又不需要 workerId 协调。代价是同毫秒内的号段分配要保证唯一——通常做法是让数据库的取号语句同时返回时间戳（<code>SELECT NOW(3), max_id</code>），实例用返回的时间戳与号段拼装 ID。这个变体的位预算比标准 Snowflake 宽松，因为不需要机器位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>号段模式用「向中心批量取号 + 本地递增」替代了机器身份编码，实例间无需区分身份。</li>\n<li>双缓冲加异步预取是把取号延迟尖刺抹平的关键，预取失败必须可容忍。</li>\n<li><code>step</code> 同时调节数据库压力、崩溃浪费与尖刺频率，按「峰值 QPS × 目标续期秒数」反推是实用取法。</li>\n<li>空号段作为主键完全无害，只在需要连号或监控号差时成为问题。</li>\n<li>相比 Snowflake，号段模式不受时钟回拨影响，但硬依赖数据库补货且 ID 无时间语义。</li>\n<li>混合方案（时间戳高位 + 号段低位）可兼得时间可读性与去中心化，代价是取号语句需同时返回时间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"号段/Leaf 模式：数据库取号与本地缓存","id":"号段-leaf-模式-数据库取号与本地缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双缓冲：把取号延迟藏起来","id":"双缓冲-把取号延迟藏起来"},{"level":2,"text":"step 的取值：空洞、延迟与数据库压力的三角","id":"step-的取值-空洞-延迟与数据库压力的三角"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Snowflake 的取舍和混合方案","id":"与-snowflake-的取舍和混合方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"workerId 分配、冲突与中心化注册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-id-clock-ordering/snowflake-family/worker-id-allocation"},"next":{"title":"时钟回拨检测与防护策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-id-clock-ordering/snowflake-family/clock-rollback"}}